==================================================================================
PARITY (web TourLauncher.tsx -> native), no scope narrowing
==================================================================================
  Data sources (web hooks -> native P1/S8 seam):
    useTranslation              -> TourLauncherStrings facade (P1/S10), no literals.
    useLocation().pathname      -> TourLauncherUpdate.pathname, fed to isRecommended.
    listTours()                 -> TourCatalog.all (main, vehicles, drives, charging,
                                   alerts, automations, settings, debugger).
    isTourCompleted(id,version) -> TourLauncherUpdate.completedIDs (source-owned store).
    isRecommendedForRoute       -> TourRouteMatch.matches(pathname:) — verbatim port:
                                   '/' => pathname=='/'; string p => ==p || startsWith
                                   p+'/'; RegExp => firstMatch != nil. Unit-tested for
                                   all 8 routeMatches + the boundary + invalid-pattern.
    dispatchTourStart(def.id)   -> TourLauncherController.startTour(id:).
    markTourListSeen()          -> TourLauncherController.markListSeen() (on open).
    resetAllTours()             -> TourLauncherSource.resetAllTours() (re-pushes clear).
  Composition (web Modal body -> native):
    Modal title "Take a tour"   -> header title + freshness chip + close "×".
    subtitle paragraph          -> TourLauncherSubtitle.
    <ul> tours.map(<li>)        -> ForEach(model.rows) TourLauncherRowView:
      Check / PlayCircle glyph  -> TourRowGlyph (checkmark / play.fill).
      recommended highlight     -> accent-tinted + accent-bordered row.
      Sparkles "Recommended …"  -> TourRecommendedBadge (sparkles + accent chip).
      emerald "Completed"       -> TourCompletedBadge (statusSuccess chip).
      title / description        -> verbatim row.title / row.description.
      Button primary|ghost       -> TSButton(variant: recommended ? .primary : .ghost),
                                   label Start|Replay, aria "Start/Replay tour: {title}".
    footer Reset all + Close    -> TourLauncherFooter (reset text button + Close button)
                                   over a divider; header also carries the modal close.
    handleStart (close+dispatch)-> row tap: onClose() then model.startTour(id).
  Tailwind classes were NOT ported; chrome is P1/S9 tokens (TSSpacing/TSRadius/Color.TS/
  Font.TS) via TSGlassPanel/TSFadeIn/TSButton.

==================================================================================
STATES (every state renders — no hidden surfaces)
==================================================================================
  loading  -> TourLauncherLoadingState (spinner + "Loading tours…").
  empty    -> TourLauncherEmptyState (ContentUnavailableView "No tours available").
  error    -> TourLauncherErrorState (QueryError-equivalent + Retry -> model.refresh()).
  stale    -> freshness chip "Stale" + connectivity banner + ONE guarded auto-refresh.
  offline  -> freshness chip "Offline" + banner; cached rows kept; no refetch.
  content  -> the populated launcher list + footer (+ inline reload error if a refresh
             failed while cached rows remain).
  Telemetry: model.start() emits P1/S11 view.opened surface="TourLauncher" (once,
  idempotent — ModelTests proven).

